    "dressing_note": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "section_id": "sesame-dressing",
        "liquid": "<style>\n  .sea-sheet {\n    --ink: #171717;\n    --muted: #5c5c5c;\n    --line: #e5e2dc;\n    --wash: #faf8f4;\n    --gold: #bb8f50;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    background: var(--wash);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 30px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__eyebrow {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    letter-spacing: .14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--gold);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 8px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__heading {\n    font-size: clamp(23px, 2.8vw, 30px);\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n    max-width: 22ch;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__lede {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    margin: 0 0 24px;\n    max-width: 68ch;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__cols {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: 14px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__col {\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 18px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__col--pick {\n    border-color: var(--gold);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--gold);\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__num {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 26px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--ink);\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__col h3 {\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    margin: 0 0 7px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__col p {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__foot {\n    margin: 18px 0 0;\n    padding-top: 14px;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 749px) {\n    .sea-sheet {\n      padding: 22px;\n    }\n    .sea-sheet__cols {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n  }\n\n  .sea-sheet__fig {\n    margin: 22px auto 0;\n    max-width: 360px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__fig img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n    display: block;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    box-shadow: 0 14px 34px -22px rgba(0,0,0,.5);\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__figcap {\n    margin: 10px auto 0;\n    max-width: 360px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"sea-sheet\">\n  <p class=\"sea-sheet__eyebrow\">The simple sesame dressing</p>\n  <h2 class=\"sea-sheet__heading\">Three parts sesame oil, two parts rice vinegar.</h2>\n  <p class=\"sea-sheet__lede\">\n    That ratio is the whole recipe, plus a pinch of sea salt. Make as much or as little as your lettuce needs,\n    and dress the salad lightly so the leaves stay crisp.\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"sea-sheet__cols\">\n    <div class=\"sea-sheet__col sea-sheet__col--pick\">\n      <span class=\"sea-sheet__num\">1</span>\n      <h3>Whisk it</h3>\n      <p>Three parts sesame oil to two parts rice vinegar, with a pinch of sea salt. Whisk until it comes\n      together.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sea-sheet__col\">\n      <span class=\"sea-sheet__num\">2</span>\n      <h3>Toss by hand</h3>\n      <p>Add just enough to the baby lettuces to lightly coat them, and toss with your hands so you don&rsquo;t\n      crush the delicate leaves.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sea-sheet__col\">\n      <span class=\"sea-sheet__num\">3</span>\n      <h3>Dress it last</h3>\n      <p>Toss the salad right before the bowls are built. Butter lettuce and baby romaine wilt quickly once\n      they are dressed.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <figure class=\"sea-sheet__fig\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/nicolepaggi_seatopiaverticalimg1.jpg?width=760\" alt=\"Nicole Paggi pouring sesame dressing over a glass bowl of baby lettuces\" width=\"2357\" height=\"3480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <figcaption class=\"sea-sheet__figcap\">\n      Just enough to coat. You can always add more.\n    </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n</div>",
